{# 视角切换：同一篇作品的两种读法。
   用两条路由（不是查询参数）——缓存按路径做键，参数会让两套内容互相覆盖。 #}
<div class="wrap">
  <nav class="views" aria-label="切换视角">
    <a class="views__a{% if view == 'reader' %} is-on{% endif %}"{% if view == 'reader' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} href="/library/works/{{ work.code }}">
      <span class="views__t">读者视角</span>
    </a>
    <a class="views__a{% if view == 'author' %} is-on{% endif %}"{% if view == 'author' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} href="/library/works/{{ work.code }}/author">
      <span class="views__t">作者视角</span>
    </a>
  </nav>
</div>
